{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As He marveled upon His greatest work,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He knew that it must be hidden 'mongst shadows and murk.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so He ripped an island from deep blue seas,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Uniting it unto itself at each of its seams.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden within the infinite expanse,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fragments of His stone doth twinkle and dance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so began the world He wove,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So began...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Alchemist's Alcove.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568090/extras/877f960455131062b723c2973f450e4e.avif?t=1755964200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568090/extras_big/877f960455131062b723c2973f450e4e.avif?t=1755964200 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemist's Alcove</strong> is an <strong>Exploration-Focused Traditional Roguelike</strong> where you <strong>craft unique spells and tools</strong> using the remains of your fallen enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong>, <strong>Craft</strong>, <strong>Discover</strong>, and <strong>Die</strong> as you trudge forth through <strong>ancient lands</strong> and <strong>warring factions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KNOWLEDGE IS POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Alchemist's Alcove, the only meta-progression you will earn is your knowledge of the game. Fill out your notebook, study your enemies, and learn more about the world within the Alcove.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle, battle, triumph, and wither as you embark on your journey to forge the Philosopher's Stone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIMPLE TO LEARN, DIFFICULT TO MASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemist's Alcove features an easy-to-understand crafting system that forces players to stretch their resource-management skills to their limit, with a massive arsenal of items to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft spells to cast, weapons to wield, and tools to aid you on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VAST WORLD RIPE FOR DISCOVERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world within Alchemist's Alcove is static, with consistent environments and landmarks across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lands within the Alcove to discover its rich history, and uncover ancient mysteries!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568090?t=1755964200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568090?t=1755964200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568090/6b11dcbc102b0014e45697857bd9e2b89b5e6c95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755964200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568090/6b11dcbc102b0014e45697857bd9e2b89b5e6c95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755964200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Non-realistic depictions of violence"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3731330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As He marveled upon His greatest work,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He knew that it must be hidden 'mongst shadows and murk.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so He ripped an island from deep blue seas,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Uniting it unto itself at each of its seams.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden within the infinite expanse,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fragments of His stone doth twinkle and dance.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so began the world He wove,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So began...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Alchemist's Alcove.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568090/extras/877f960455131062b723c2973f450e4e.avif?t=1755964200\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568090/extras_big/877f960455131062b723c2973f450e4e.avif?t=1755964200 width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemist's Alcove</strong> is an <strong>Exploration-Focused Traditional Roguelike</strong> where you <strong>craft unique spells and tools</strong> using the remains of your fallen enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong>, <strong>Craft</strong>, <strong>Discover</strong>, and <strong>Die</strong> as you trudge forth through <strong>ancient lands</strong> and <strong>warring factions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KNOWLEDGE IS POWER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Alchemist's Alcove, the only meta-progression you will earn is your knowledge of the game. Fill out your notebook, study your enemies, and learn more about the world within the Alcove.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggle, battle, triumph, and wither as you embark on your journey to forge the Philosopher's Stone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SIMPLE TO LEARN, DIFFICULT TO MASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemist's Alcove features an easy-to-understand crafting system that forces players to stretch their resource-management skills to their limit, with a massive arsenal of items to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft spells to cast, weapons to wield, and tools to aid you on your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A VAST WORLD RIPE FOR DISCOVERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world within Alchemist's Alcove is static, with consistent environments and landmarks across runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lands within the Alcove to discover its rich history, and uncover ancient mysteries!</p>","developers":["Nefarious Brew Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568090/28d8db4b46323002048b032b5305e8bf7a3c3261/header.jpg?t=1755964200","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568090/1681575253/3938107d7e884fd76b38b6ffafa112e031b594af/1753423080/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754323694","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568090/1681575253/3938107d7e884fd76b38b6ffafa112e031b594af/1753423080/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754323694","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3568090/1681575253/3938107d7e884fd76b38b6ffafa112e031b594af/1753423080/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754323694","id":257173768,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173768/movie480.mp4?t=1754323694","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173768/movie_max.mp4?t=1754323694"},"name":"Alchemist's Alcove Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i